{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"*Quin the Vampire is making a rare trip above ground to grab some supplies, and as they're heading back through the ruined streets of Hampstead, moving towards one of the many sewer entrances, when, they happen upon a young man, with no home, having lost his family in the fires. He's sitting in the burnt remains of a house, coughing profusely. Quin goes to sit with him, and although the man is surprised by the Nosferatu's appearance, he's too weak from his injuries to make an attempt to leave.*","created_at":"2021-08-28T05:52:31.291000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"881053616218185788","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"\"Doctors told me I inhaled some bad fumes during the fires. Said I've got, 4, maybe five months.\" *The man tells Quin with a melancholic expression. He chuckles.* \"Kinda funny, the irony, right? surviving all this just to die?\" *The man's chuckles turn to violent coughs that cause Quin to wince.*","created_at":"2021-08-28T05:54:56.793000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"881054226497822740","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"*The two sit in silence for a minute, before Quin sits up, a memory flashing in their head. They turn to the man, and motion for him to hold out his hand. The young man is confused, but complies, and Quin takes his hand, reaching up and pointing to their sharp fangs with the other.* \"What? what are you...\" *The man's eyes widen as he realizes what the Vampire is suggesting.*","created_at":"2021-08-28T05:59:07.291000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"881055277162577980","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"\"Would I be, healed?\" *The man asks after a moment.*","created_at":"2021-08-28T06:01:53.080000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"881055972532035594","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
